EESchema-LIBRARY Version 2.4
#encoding utf-8
#
# SMA_EDGE
#
DEF SMA_EDGE U 0 40 Y Y 1 F N
F0 "U" 0 100 50 H V C CNN
F1 "SMA_EDGE" 0 200 50 H V C CNN
F2 "" 0 0 50 H I C CNN
F3 "" 0 0 50 H I C CNN
DRAW
S -150 50 150 -100 0 1 0 N
X 1 1 -100 -200 100 U 50 50 1 1 B
X 2 2 0 -200 100 U 50 50 1 1 B
X 3 3 100 -200 100 U 50 50 1 1 B
ENDDRAW
ENDDEF
